# oc-sim scenario v1
# The graphics demonstration (journal/D-030), page 3 of five: open the app
# menu, move the highlight down twice to GFX DEMO, launch it with the right
# encoder, then turn the left encoder to the page. The animations run from the
# ticks' elapsed time, so the snapshot is the same on every run.
ticks 700
20  button up down
60  button down down
70  button up up
70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
110 button down down
120 button down up
140 button right down
146 button right up
200 encoder 1 +2
